Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,Congratulations on graduating!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.61,0:00:09.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}In 1988 in my original life,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.53,0:00:12.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Kayo, Hiromi, and Nakanishi Aya went missing
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.79,0:00:14.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}and were later found dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I blamed myself for not being able to save anyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.63,0:00:22.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I tried my hardest to forget all about it...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.77,0:00:28.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}and was left with nothing\N but a gaping hole in my heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.27,0:00:35.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,You've experienced joy, sorrow, success, and failure.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.49,0:00:41.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,Today you graduate elementary school,\Nbut you're all still lacking in many ways.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.21,0:00:44.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,And I'm no different.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.20,0:00:51.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,But I believe that filling the holes\Nin ourselves is what life's all about.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.69,0:02:31.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.97,0:02:35.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who're you?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.43,0:02:37.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Fujinuma Satoru, a fifth-grader at Mikoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.57,0:02:38.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Kobayashi Kenya.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.99,0:02:40.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Sugita Hiromi.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.86,0:02:42.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Have we met before?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.23,0:02:44.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're Nakanishi Aya-san, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.21,0:02:45.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I hear you're pretty good at piano.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.03,0:02:48.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty good, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.68,0:02:51.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Have we met at piano class?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.42,0:02:53.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.71,0:02:55.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Say, what's that book you're reading?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.68,0:02:58.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shakespeare.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.59,0:02:59.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,King Lear?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.73,0:03:02.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've only read Romeo and Juliet.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.16,0:03:05.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My parents keep pushing me to \Nplay the piano and read Shakespeare.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.71,0:03:08.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What're they talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.76,0:03:11.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wanna get a little bit closer?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.26,0:03:14.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ah! I thought you guys looked familiar!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.39,0:03:17.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're the kids who're always sneaking\Ninto that building across the river!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.15,0:03:22.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Our hideout is totally visible from here?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.45,0:03:23.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hideout?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.19,0:03:25.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How childish.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.11,0:03:27.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ch-Ch-Chi—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.64,0:03:29.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't call it childish.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.73,0:03:34.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You boys are always sneaking around,\Nmaking secret bases or hideouts or whatever.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.68,0:03:36.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I bet you pretend to be superheroes or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.58,0:03:39.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,D-Don't make fun of superheroes!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.33,0:03:41.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.34,0:03:44.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I have to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.44,0:03:45.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.42,0:03:48.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.64,0:03:50.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kazu?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.14,0:03:51.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.89,0:03:53.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you want?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.35,0:03:54.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hideouts are...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.21,0:03:58.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,a symbol of adventure for men!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.27,0:04:04.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Try visiting our hideout when you're free!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.49,0:04:06.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Then you'll understand!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.85,0:04:08.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're a bunch of weirdos!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.33,0:04:14.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How childish.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.45,0:04:18.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was fun, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.47,0:04:23.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I really did forget those gloves\Nthat I lost 18 years ago here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.75,0:04:26.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I really don't like grinding.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.57,0:04:28.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But that's the fun part!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.05,0:04:32.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Satoru-kun,\N Nakanishi-san should be {showing }at the park soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.89,0:04:33.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's all good.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.80,0:04:36.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We can see her from here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.42,0:04:37.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.76,0:04:40.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We messed up pretty bad yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.01,0:04:42.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But how are we supposed to get closer to her?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.00,0:04:50.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was free, so I figured I'd come see your hideout.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.71,0:04:56.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome to our hideout!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.74,0:05:00.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.60,0:05:01.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.55,0:05:07.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Going to pick up Aya-chan again?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.46,0:05:10.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yep. We'll both head to the hideout later.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.87,0:05:12.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.49,0:05:15.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters, Sensei!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You mean "goodbye," young man.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.85,0:05:19.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe those two got together.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.51,0:05:23.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess that solves the Nakanishi Aya problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.29,0:05:23.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.56,0:05:29.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Satoru-kun, Kenya-kun. Thank you both.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.98,0:05:34.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think getting rid of loneliness is a great thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.31,0:05:40.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know how it feels. I was always alone because\N both my parents work and are never really home.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.48,0:05:46.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You helped me get rid of mine and asked me \Nto help to get rid of Kayo-chan's and Aya-chan's.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.19,0:05:48.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That made me really happy!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.11,0:05:52.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.84,0:05:55.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the hideout already! I'm sick of waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.38,0:05:58.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Kazu?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He went to pick up Aya-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.10,0:06:00.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.62,0:06:02.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "why"?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.90,0:06:05.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, she knows where the hideout is.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.48,0:06:07.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.52,0:06:09.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever, let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.79,0:06:11.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.36,0:06:13.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goodbye, Sensei!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.03,0:06:19.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Step on it!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.31,0:06:20.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be in such a rush!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.74,0:06:23.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.33,0:06:26.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.09,0:06:28.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nakanishi Aya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.31,0:06:30.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sugita Hiromi.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.08,0:06:32.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And Hinazuki Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.31,0:06:37.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The three of them were to be killed, \Nbut they must no longer be targets at this point.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.13,0:06:42.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not sure I can find him anymore, though,\Nnow that I've lost all my leads.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.48,0:06:44.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There. Now you look even more like a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.03,0:06:46.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it great?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.92,0:06:47.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.41,0:06:51.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are we done playing detective?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.58,0:06:55.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Of course not. It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.86,0:07:03.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In 2006, my mother told Sawada-san that\Nshe figured out who the real culprit was,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.26,0:07:09.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}which means it was probably\Nsomeone she knew back in 1988.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.45,0:07:11.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Comparing it to Sensei's candy is weird,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.56,0:07:16.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but now that the killer has lost his targets,\Nhe's surely looking for a substitute.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.58,0:07:27.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.43,0:07:35.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, we're gonna go watch the ice hockey game.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.76,0:07:37.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is Hamada playing?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.09,0:07:37.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.76,0:07:39.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.38,0:07:41.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tell him I wish him good luck.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.24,0:07:42.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.06,0:07:42.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.90,0:07:46.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.92,0:07:51.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed \NYanagihara-san's been all alone lately?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.00,0:07:53.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Misato?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.32,0:07:58.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's become cut off from the rest of \Nthe class after that whole lunch money incident.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.82,0:08:00.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.16,0:08:02.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll try talking to her on Monday.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.78,0:08:03.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.86,0:08:12.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.35,0:08:21.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I might be a bit late today.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.42,0:08:26.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, but call me as soon as you\Nknow what time you'll be here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.37,0:08:28.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it. Bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.58,0:08:31.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day, Satoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.46,0:08:36.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sensei said he'd give us a ride in his car!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.31,0:08:37.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.62,0:08:39.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go and leave you-know-who behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.34,0:08:43.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,45,,Sounds good. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.26,0:08:43.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How can I start a conversation with her?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.32,0:08:50.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's taking the bus?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.40,0:08:58.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I hear Misato's been all alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.88,0:09:03.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.53,0:09:06.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's probably headed to Wakaba Gym.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.84,0:09:07.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.92,0:09:12.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yashiro-sensei said he invited her\Nto go cheer on Hamada-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.39,0:09:15.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, we saw her \Nwatching the game by herself last week.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.69,0:09:16.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.84,0:09:18.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Want us to come?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.45,0:09:22.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's probably better that I go alone.\NI'm just going to see what's up, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.30,0:09:23.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.05,0:09:27.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If we're still playing detective,\Ngive us a report tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.76,0:09:28.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.73,0:09:31.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come to the hideout if you need anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.11,0:09:32.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay. Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.56,0:09:33.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.61,0:09:35.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.09,0:09:35.07,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.07,0:09:36.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.04,0:09:37.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.73,0:09:40.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He makes such a big deal out of it every day.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.73,0:09:42.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.13,0:09:44.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's not like we won't see each other tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.86,0:09:49.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Man, it's actually colder in here.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.30,0:09:52.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Hamada!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.43,0:09:54.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kick some butt, Kouichi!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.34,0:09:56.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, fugly! Just watch with your mouth shut!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.46,0:09:58.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell us what to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.66,0:10:00.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Watch your language, Kouichi.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.80,0:10:02.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Or else you won't get any food!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.06,0:10:04.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.47,0:10:12.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There she is.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.96,0:10:14.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And she really is all by herself.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.10,0:10:17.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All right, start warming up.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.61,0:10:19.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.59,0:10:25.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At any rate, she'd make an ideal target\Nfor a killer who's lost two others at once.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.54,0:10:32.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, the toilet.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.00,0:10:37.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The game starts in five minutes!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.17,0:10:38.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.95,0:10:41.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's taking way too long.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.21,0:10:51.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I had to take a lollipop break.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.74,0:10:53.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.90,0:10:55.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The game's about to start.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.97,0:10:57.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.55,0:11:02.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,W-Well, uh, I wanted to talk to Misato.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.32,0:11:03.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Misato?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.44,0:11:08.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.59,0:11:11.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did she leave?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.59,0:11:12.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.54,0:11:14.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the game hasn't even started yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.13,0:11:22.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Shiratoris' truck?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.12,0:11:24.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sensei, there's something \NI have to check right away!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.15,0:11:26.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.06,0:11:34.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If what you're saying is true, this is a crime here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.35,0:11:37.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We call it "playing detective."
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.49,0:11:39.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We pretend there's a kidnapper on the prowl
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.76,0:11:43.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and talk to girls who are often alone\Nand make friends with them.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.72,0:11:47.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's sort of a precautionary measure\Nagainst kidnappings.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.08,0:11:51.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't matter if you're only\N "playing" when you're getting results.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.89,0:11:53.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.41,0:11:57.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fasten your seat belt, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.13,0:12:02.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.42,0:12:06.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's been acting up lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.95,0:12:07.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.81,0:12:16.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So you've realized Misato has been all alone lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.47,0:12:19.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I actually didn't until Hiromi told me.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.48,0:12:23.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Still, I admire your spirit and bravery.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.94,0:12:25.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.80,0:12:29.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But this time, I hid behind the excuse \Nthat things were awkward between us...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.53,0:12:32.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...and ended up using her like bait.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.74,0:12:37.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bait, huh? You must be pretty serious about this.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.40,0:12:42.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So that's why you've suddenly been\Nawfully friendly with people lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.46,0:12:46.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I want to fill the gaping\Nhole in everyone's hearts.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.91,0:12:48.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Both mine and other people's.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.31,0:12:53.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap! Those were Yashiro's words!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.85,0:12:57.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Great minds think alike, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.77,0:13:00.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's my exact philosophy in life.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.82,0:13:05.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'd planned on talking about it on graduation\Nday if I was ever put in charge of sixth grade.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.08,0:13:13.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You may regret using Misato as bait, but there's\Nno need to feel guilty or ashamed about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.73,0:13:18.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good deeds and bad deeds\N are two sides of the same coin.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.67,0:13:22.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're but things people do \Nto make up for their shortcomings.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.06,0:13:25.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's an extreme way of thinking.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.35,0:13:29.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've done all kinds of things to get\Ncloser to a certain person myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.97,0:13:32.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sometimes straightforward, sometimes roundabout.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.50,0:13:36.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've even resorted to what you'd call "foul play."
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.11,0:13:39.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's been so much fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.92,0:13:42.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Er, a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.16,0:13:45.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess it is similar to romance in some ways.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.24,0:13:49.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,At the very least, they're both ways\Nto fill a hole in one's heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.53,0:13:53.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, want a candy?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.12,0:13:58.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.71,0:14:00.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But there's no candy in there.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.07,0:14:08.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,After all, this isn't my car.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.72,0:14:24.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, this isn't your car?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.54,0:14:30.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think one's happiest moment\Nin life always changes?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.53,0:14:33.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Because mine changed just now.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.70,0:14:38.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing beats that moment when\Nyou fill that void in your heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.65,0:14:42.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When you find what you're looking\Nfor and try to make it yours,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.84,0:14:48.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,the more hurdles you face, the more happiness\Nyou obtain when you overcome them.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.52,0:14:51.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't get it. What the hell is he talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.28,0:14:53.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Laxatives?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.42,0:14:57.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can tell you lied to me about one thing, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.36,0:15:00.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You said you "pretend"\Nthere's a kidnapper on the prowl,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.24,0:15:03.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but you're acting under \Nthe certainty that there is one.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.27,0:15:08.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I refused to accept it. I couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.50,0:15:11.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Or rather I didn't want to believe...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.48,0:15:17.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,that someone could predict my thoughts.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.59,0:15:29.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Relax. Misato's not in that truck.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.06,0:15:34.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The only one in it is Shiratori Jun's father.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.47,0:15:44.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I had no idea until I saw you \Nfollowing Nakanishi Aya that day.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.89,0:15:49.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The day I gave you and your mother a ride \Nwas the day I was going to carry out my plan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.97,0:15:52.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And yet, laughably,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.24,0:15:57.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,there I was, seriously giving you\Nadvice on how to steal my prey.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.77,0:16:03.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was the second time you foiled my plans.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.11,0:16:06.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I began to suspect it was no mere coincidence.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.04,0:16:10.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So I urged the lonesome Misato\Nto watch the ice hockey games...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.23,0:16:12.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...and told Hiromi about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.22,0:16:17.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And if you showed up,\Nmy suspicion would turn to conviction.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.76,0:16:19.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That you're my enemy.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.80,0:16:21.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.26,0:16:27.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I waited for the right time, \Ngave Misato a drink laced with laxative,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.06,0:16:30.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and ordered food parcels from Shiratori Foods.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.05,0:16:31.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It can't be...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.47,0:16:33.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It can't be!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.51,0:16:37.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of the puzzle fell \Nright into place, just as I'd planned.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.74,0:16:41.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is who I really am.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.48,0:16:46.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, I picked up this car right before coming.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.29,0:16:50.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My standards for choosing a car\Nare a tad different from others.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.05,0:16:53.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There should be several cars of\N the same make and color in the area,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.43,0:16:56.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,so I can use them \Nas dummies whenever I want.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.16,0:16:59.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is the first time they've ever come in handy, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.68,0:17:02.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm such a fool.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.12,0:17:11.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}The truth was under my nose all along.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.53,0:17:15.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,Kayo will be all right now.{flashback, ep9}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.02,0:17:17.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I just didn't accept it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.29,0:17:21.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Yashiro Gaku's name was on \Nthe suspect list I saw at Sawada-san's place.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.00,0:17:25.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}But because my mother's name was also on it,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.79,0:17:31.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Because I trusted Yashiro so much,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.22,0:17:34.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I tried to remove him\N from my own list of suspects.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.49,0:17:36.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.88,0:17:41.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the killer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.46,0:17:44.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the Yashiro I see in front of my eyes right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.35,0:17:28.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I didn't think the list was important.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.90,0:18:11.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's started to snow.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.60,0:18:21.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You can't take it off.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.06,0:18:24.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's game over.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.62,0:18:26.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,For the both of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.67,0:18:42.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe it, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.58,0:18:46.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You predicted my moves every step\Nof the way and destroyed my plans.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.36,0:18:49.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It sends shivers down my spine\Nthat you've forced me into this.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.11,0:18:57.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's almost like you've seen the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.38,0:19:02.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want it keeping me up at night,\Nso let me get it out of the way.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.98,0:19:07.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What I'm about to do isn't an act of revenge\Nagainst you for foiling my plans.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.40,0:19:11.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I seriously do admire you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.96,0:19:17.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Think of it as a substitute for \Nmy desire that couldn't be fulfilled.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.62,0:19:19.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say it was game over for you too?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.07,0:19:27.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're going to bring peace to this town, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.81,0:19:30.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that exactly what you wanted?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.61,0:19:35.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to bring upon your death\Nby my hands, and for my sake alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.58,0:19:39.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Yashiro!\NI won't die until I see you destroyed!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.17,0:19:42.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's what they call being overambitious.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.46,0:19:47.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yashiro, you bastard!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.40,0:19:49.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.96,0:19:54.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.72,0:19:55.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.06,0:19:58.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've decided to leave this town.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.19,0:20:04.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yashiro!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.71,0:20:07.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know what lies in your future!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.61,0:20:11.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.73,0:20:13.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's freezing.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.13,0:20:17.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shit!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.72,0:20:18.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not good!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.65,0:20:29.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going numb...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.13,0:20:33.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm screwed...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.30,0:20:45.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Oh, Ma.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.49,0:20:47.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,What is it, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.63,0:20:49.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Our eyes often met when I looked up at her.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.54,0:20:53.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Guys...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.72,0:20:55.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,Satoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.72,0:20:55.12,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,143,,Satoru-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.28,0:20:59.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,Thank you, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.95,0:21:00.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Kayo...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.03,0:21:07.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Airi...

